    1 // Package detect classifies text into content types so the right optimizer
602c5ffb dev 2026-10-10
    2 // handles it. A type is "family/dialect": the family names what the output is
    3 // for (test, build, pkg, table, k8s, cloud…) and picks the engine; the dialect
    4 // names the tool or format and tunes it. Detection uses, in order: the command
    5 // that produced the text, a file name or MIME type, then content sniffing.
    6 // Dialects are declared as specs in this package, one file per family.
54c53fae dev 2026-10-10
    7 package detect
